{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"453e02f7c1e29fa8acec955ed75aed55112ed153091a9c2499df7b9862c0f405","ja":"今日のお仕事は、MVの撮影。\n一旦、一通りの撮影が終わって……","zh":"今天的工作是MV的拍摄。\n一轮拍摄暂时告一段落，然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2993caaadaa8c391295f1fbed3a2821b3dd4def40a5d3fd176b25dcba218c284","ja":"「はい！　オッケーです！」","zh":"「好！没问题！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5eafa6585caabe62fd5dbbc6a0ad94246293699df1b54f54cde1aa6447d288c3","ja":"さっきのミキたち、かわいく踊れてたよね？\nライブのときと、同じくらいだったかもなの♪","zh":"刚才的美希她们，跳得很可爱吧？\n感觉都快赶上演出的时候了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ddc9d4daf3dd4835bbed10471a0063d85cb853b4be1a10ac7ddf6bfa4e2af96a","ja":"ああ！　気合い入ってたからな♪","zh":"啊！毕竟干劲十足嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"f57b6f65d9dbb960f6c0798ceb598a9d8dd4af9385315f65edc90337407c3226","ja":"「ダンス映像、いい感じに仕上がりそうです！\nただ、監督が他のパターンもほしいそうで……」","zh":"“舞蹈视频感觉能制作得很不错！\n只是，导演好像还想要其他的版本……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"02507ccc306860057938df6a2c41287b36f74d4f241791dc1c0538019a077040","ja":"「先日のみなさんのショーがとっても素敵だったので、\nお任せしてみたいとのことですが……どうでしょう？」","zh":"“对方说‘前些天大家的演出非常棒，\n想试着委托给你们……’，意下如何呢？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"2277226ae0134b913e6d2473f968efb512636d8e4389dd15c4eda1eb5ddd4f83","ja":"あら、それは光栄ね♪\nぜひとも、やらせてほしいわ。ね、みんな？","zh":"哎呀，那真是深感荣幸呢♪\n请务必让我们做。对吧，大家？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"89294797d81abe788ac4dd96897498b1c911dc2a093fdddc25b0862bd604e1aa","ja":"はい、ぜひ～。\nどういうのがいいでしょうか～？","zh":"好的，很乐意～\n您想要什么样的呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"e1b9974df824fb1cf9bf5a627978d0cb747626001d3b2e2da9593e26eb7192e2","ja":"ミキ的には、もっといーっぱい、\nかわいさをアピールするのがいいって思うな。","zh":"美希觉得，要是能再多多地、\n展现自己的可爱就更好了呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"074dcd693d20bc0b4da3aa4148984a592cdf922dc7a7f4603bb61cdb09e19b68","ja":"上目遣いで……手を頬に添えて……\nね？　あざといくらい、かわいいでしょ？","zh":"略带仰视……把手贴在脸颊上……\n看吧？是不是可爱到有点耍心机了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"f4570cca6d64931ee890fa6d1b0ae594dfcbb0565d2b59a45d1e4d2b592b9268","ja":"な、なるほどな……。\n……こ、こんな感じか？","zh":"原、原来是这样啊……。\n……是、是这种感觉吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0726243bf970f6ee8faa3c6421ad17bd547f0080727a237c9a6ffb054ae44b94","ja":"……ジュリア、にらんでるみたいなの。","zh":"……茱莉亚，好像在瞪人呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1612.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"f472524ca22b4cab1cda8ddfb8a7dec16406ef61afa7abbd32b963dbad439472","ja":"ええっ！？　あたしなりに\n美希と同じこと、やってみたつもりなのに～！？","zh":"诶诶！？明明我也按自己的方式，\n照着美希的样子去做了啊～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
